INITIALIZE REPLACING: a category named twice (X3.23-1985 INITIALIZE syntax rule 3)
INITIALIZE: 'rn' is a RENAMES item (X3.23-1985 INITIALIZE syntax rule 6)
the index-name 'hi' is not an operand of INITIALIZE; SET it, or SET an integer item from it (X3.23-1985 OCCURS syntax rule 13)
INITIALIZE WITH FILLER / TO VALUE / TO DEFAULT is COBOL 2002; compile with -std=2002
